## PRD: Basket Store and UI Controls

### Definition of Done

[ ] Zustand basket store with {productId, quantity} shape

[ ] ui basket controls
    [ ] ui basket controls elements rendering should adapt based on a product's presence in the basket store
        [ ] when a product is not present in basket store, should render add button only
        [ ] when a product is present in basket store, should not render add button; should render decrement / increment controls with basket store quantity  
        [ ] should not render at all when a product's stock === 0 
        [ ] only on basket page - should render 'X' button for deleting item from basket 

    [ ] ui basket controls logic
        [ ] should receive props max based on product stock 
        [ ] on increment click, should increment quantity only up to max, should not be possible to increment past max
        [ ] on decrement click
            [ ] anywhere except basket page - should decrement up to 0, should not be possible to decrement past 0
            [ ] only on basket page - should decrement up to 1, should not be possible to decrement past 1
            [ ] only on basket page - clicking 'X' button for deleting item from basket, deletes item from basket

            


